@ 26.6 - Proto-Mande to Southwest Mande
# citation: Pogostick Man, from Dwyer, David J. (1987/1988), “Towards Proto Mande Morphology”. Mandekan: Bulletin semestriel d’études linguistiques 14/15:139 – 152
	f > p
	{tʼ,d} {kʼ,ɡ} > l k
	z > s
	w > ɡ
	ŋ > ɲ
	kp kpʼ ɡb > {k,B} kp B (it’s unclear what this 〈B〉 is)